#: 695c96b88a7d486284cc51b683b7f86b e7b96772324341719bfd0a405394dccf
#: f831fcec6068418fb45553782cc9af39
msgid "**ARCHIVED**"
msgstr "**已归档**"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-drotagx.rst:7
#: 19ad2896b8d34d1ea8f58a33644861e7 38b2dfe9a0db4b6cb79b1cf0c1bfde0b
#: 8410f89e369149f7b293be2dc0237fad b800995ce0c043c58d10f0b912829e17
#: f656076ffe604e1b9dd00dacd6559296
msgid "DROTAG x for Geotagging"
msgstr "DROTAG x 地理标记"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-drotagx.rst:13
#: 53ccb9512ce342b4a592a81c68cbd412 77d9583601e042dfa468143a71d9f1ea
#: 7cd567f480e74344ae600e84fcee4cb8 9da1501621d34954a90125028b1c9d6f
#: f49b8dfb2cd04241a5763d828a6fccf8
msgid ""
"`DROTAGx <https://www.airborneprojects.com/product/drotag-onboard-image-"
"tagging-computer/>`__ makes geo-tagging easy by recording the vehicle's "
"position directly into the images on the camera."
msgstr ""
"`DROTAGx <https://www.airborneprojects.com/product/drotag-onboard-image-"
"tagging-computer/>`__ 通过将飞行器位置直接记录到相机中的图像，使地理标记变得简便。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-drotagx.rst:15
#: 145e4b9855a24006afc0b709bf9a83e4 266c6f5a66f74686874b44771e478ccd
#: 551394f3c6fd441c892522122fac81f5 68704ef97b454e0da98faf7b90ccb574
#: eee5efc5121f4fc4ba1cb4247ab915bd
msgid ""
"Images are geotagged with the vehicle's Latitude, Longitude and Altitude "
"(above sea level) at the moment the photo was taken.  These value can be "
"viewed with any EXIF viewer"
msgstr "图像在拍照时标记了飞行器的纬度、经度和高度（海拔）。这些值可以用任何 EXIF 查看器查看"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-drotagx.rst:16
#: 139cef90c494488d8fca19ea3a445931 24698583026b481dbb22799e9585ac5d
#: 449126c234574505a3eb00ac71495abc 4b1d0678d3f240a696f09d747034eaf9
#: 78f2d7860f7f4061abcf354c9bbc8e92
msgid ""
"Two text files are also created which include the image name, lat, lon, alt "
"above home, altitude above sea level, roll, pitch and yaw"
msgstr "还会创建两个文本文件，包含图像名称、纬度、经度、相对 Home 高度、海拔高度、横滚、俯仰和偏航"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-drotagx.rst:17
#: 1b810464324744e48b090626f76e1487 2cf91e45748c435a894eea1c703a0a5b
#: 36bfed95813740fe8be8988b6d0bcfa8 c629d2c6fdbb48a3a01a9f36e2414e01
#: dc82271dcc004259be68692351507ac6
msgid "Captures picture every 1.6 seconds"
msgstr "每 1.6 秒拍摄一张照片"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-drotagx.rst:18
#: 40501a6759f647409e0a383d438188ef 86df732a6e6743178c1783643aa85bfe
#: 93927be001cc42d881d7ff5aa4c0d18b c9f66830a1104c699e9fc0afebb89714
#: e8aa280bec424a479f28f97ac7ca8b9f
msgid ""
"Includes a Hotshoe which connects between the autopilot and your camera's "
"flash to improve the accuracy of the geo-tagging"
msgstr "包含热靴，连接在飞控和相机闪光灯之间，以提高地理标记的精度"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-drotagx.rst:20
#: 0ef0c7c86fd94a5995421a871698db7e 291b28ca83d843b0a81e652cc45e71e1
#: 9b1a3320530c469ab8e02147bc675d84 ac9d2326c9d344d8b77495b0e0834dcf
#: bb6afac5e10b4977bd8dbab6a13b67a4
msgid ""
"More details can be found in the official DrotagX manual (`web "
"<https://www.airborneprojects.com/doc/drotagx/>`__, `pdf "
"<https://www.airborneprojects.com/docs/drotagx_manual.pdf>`__) including "
"pre-flight checklists, detailed explanations for diagnosis and other tips."
msgstr ""
"更多详情请参阅官方 DrotagX 手册（`网页 "
"<https://www.airborneprojects.com/doc/drotagx/>`__，`PDF "
"<https://www.airborneprojects.com/docs/drotagx_manual.pdf>`__），包括飞行前检查清单、详细诊断说明和其他提示。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-drotagx.rst:23
#: 3e101f0d5afb401cb82128d68c4e6c5f 73836c5c5cdb45ba99dd98fef085ac05
#: 8fc1fee04bbf45d98738e1de8883905e c51152c8be7e4cb8a3ebbd8c786da0dc
#: dd352d536bd1420ab664db8e3a278f7f
msgid "Setup, Configuration"
msgstr "设置与配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-drotagx.rst:25
#: 1a3096d5a5354a7fb75b0a09ffa4cbe5 1e8406e03bc24c5e9fd24b74ee58e83c
#: 36909d67dee142a39d94c3e320d65cf1 9cbbc40e1dea4a309feb57f90e3c2c9c
#: cf759db96b9b47e2b92bc05865d96f88
msgid ""
"Connect the Drotag's 6-pin JST connector to one of the autopilot's serial "
"ports"
msgstr "将 Drotag 的 6 针 JST 连接器连接到飞控的一个串口"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-drotagx.rst:26
#: 1f015885727649ef883452473a71a515 3f82af0072fe46d58e0e07c8dcd84f99
#: a03bd990cf1f4fa7b99fff9b8160f945 a79fba960aa64b238c09fbf67d07fe09
#: af90b554e0f74ff4a85eb82207364c8b
msgid "Connect the micro USB connector to the Sony camera's \"MultiPort\""
msgstr "将 Micro USB 连接器连接到 Sony 相机的「MultiPort」"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-drotagx.rst:27
#: 0c90b8df632e4b3f9c6da320972a3889 8aa21d8b579d4091bfbb334f1a1b8678
#: a7b1e98d1c6141b48a76369ce3e4dfe3 d1a7e6df3cdf4e4d9dc313f20f3d5800
#: d7bd05518a59488891c9733a1b9bf80e
msgid ""
"Set the following parameters in ArduPilot (assuming the Drotag is connect to"
" Serial port 1) and then reboot the autopilot"
msgstr "在 ArduPilot 中设置以下参数（假设 Drotag 连接到串口 1），然后重启飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-drotagx.rst:29
#: 42e0c28aea34410ebfb1be1aeac46536 6105412a6da84ff09bf9db21e161658a
#: 8caa01b182cf4b65b197d87b302b03f7 94b36a3b01014971a13434357f527b05
#: f001fa1adea845809dc665ba9273c21b
