#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-drotagx.rst:32
#: 6fb82620be6a4c1cac8aecf48a0eff90 9622b30170fa4ddf8b875a29489f2b7b
#: ae85220f5a9e481fba9a6cf7bb3c2c49 c6e2ec42c3f1407287d581d163f2f713
#: d25d4acef77548b2b4c7141968c12b28
msgid "Turn on the camera"
msgstr "打开相机"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-drotagx.rst:33
#: 3465b2c74ed948b4843b97c82c5a362b 7ad26d2f83784c1792bf2e8f5b155969
#: 9a31ba13d69b47cdb908b20ed01e04dc c5403d7757024c16b03e7cb05ce95055
#: cb0aa049ec1347e095345a052e237a19
msgid "Power the autopilot and Drotag"
msgstr "给飞控和 Drotag 上电"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-drotagx.rst:34
#: 0823d10987eb4b04a74b2eb9c4c27378 4d65c293caac413ba06194dd7d98413b
#: 87fbb16a8fdc4c16b2621fdc96b1d613 9f86010b1b34427b855d150660bc5ea0
#: e600b26de8ec4063b52add5fc76800aa
msgid "If all goes well the following will happen:"
msgstr "如果一切正常，将发生以下情况："

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-drotagx.rst:36
#: 89a13678aace4c1982e992cfcabef4bf 8bc590737be640928705034202346e57
#: b3ebcae6bac4401a9a2d497d50069686 e9bdeccbaf094ed692c9e90a7e15f6bd
#: ec9455062ae646d89ffd3bb26968f0fb
msgid "Drotag's red LED should blink twice quickly about once per second"
msgstr "Drotag 的红色 LED 应每秒快速闪烁两次"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-drotagx.rst:37
#: 3c616c7fa5fd4d7294c574b8677b19b2 53d3b7d9c36c43c1a43fbb91e1d95128
#: 7ae5f6d162424bb1a94dd45928aec0be a230f0ee94ea42348e1d03d5b32695c5
#: f7914b4c807d4a6f9073702320db1eca
msgid ""
"The camera should switch to \"mass storage\" for about 30 seconds (or less) "
"and then return to regular shooting mode"
msgstr "相机应切换到「大容量存储」模式约 30 秒（或更短），然后返回正常拍摄模式"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-drotagx.rst:38
#: 13d4ba7329bc4ddf93098ad85471a3e5 2098ede0a722425491bbfb6e1b862173
#: 3285e50b672443229b92b108df1cf749 7f933934cc974cde9e71a9cda30adb23
#: ac9018ebd1534631b377065c988fc51a
msgid ""
"If a MAVLink Inspector is used (available in MissionPlanner and QGC) a "
"\"Component 2\" should appear and send heartbeats once every 3 seconds"
msgstr ""
"如果使用 MAVLink 检查器（在 Mission Planner 和 QGC 中可用），应出现「Component 2」并每 3 秒发送一次心跳"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-drotagx.rst:45
#: 1c076d9cf91d421fb2cf58983672190d 263236d50a5442c688a0c515d486afe7
#: a4536fc43bb146cbb8a8403efd1dec18 a6b17cde05f94c569d14630561f19c7e
#: da9aec4acfad423cb2b2642e61368c2b
msgid "Testing"
msgstr "测试"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-drotagx.rst:47
#: 01a581b5707340d6bb497075da173fdf 447817d75fcc486799839c3eafba1061
#: a02c744434d84c4aacf99ccef80839ed b29b73893dc94742906e70d403719e4c
#: cc6db1664e70422187055ba7f6390513
msgid "Test the Drotag is working correctly by doing the following"
msgstr "通过以下步骤测试 Drotag 是否正常工作"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-drotagx.rst:49
#: 36f6efa3581044d79f190ebbeaa1018b 4fe67d098b10414b82732dfcdb8211fb
#: 5f04a2cf8ca04126bd6837d29f6e2721 6ba0a1995d934de595fd0fce0f34c62a
#: 981048047c86441cb214c7f0e706b1c0
msgid ""
"Connect with Mission Planner and right-mouse-button-clicking on the map and "
"select, \"Trigger Camera Now\".  The camera should emit a click as it takes "
"a picture.  Normally a green circle will also appear on the map."
msgstr "连接 Mission Planner，在地图上右键单击并选择「立即触发相机」。相机应发出咔哒声表示拍照。通常地图上也会出现绿色圆圈。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-drotagx.rst:50
#: 56b210c4014e4d34b294c1965ece189f 6b2df96a5d794c898baf01766e95c804
#: 7700ec32c56947ddb358ca804ac7388a b0600d067ed2454e88a58d072c35aed9
#: f8fbc7194e27480e8b32ffafff7693a2
msgid ""
"Arm the vehicle, trigger another picture, then disarm the vehicle.  The "
"camera should momentarily switch to \"Mass Storage\" mode as Drotag geotags "
"the images and writes the text files"
msgstr "解锁飞行器，触发另一张照片，然后上锁飞行器。相机应短暂切换到「大容量存储」模式，因为 Drotag 正在对图像进行地理标记并写入文本文件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-drotagx.rst:57
#: 09f27c56619041c091f7ac854b6093c3 2520c5eeea3e4a43a221bbb32f5e68ca
#: 5ac0b45f76654ccdb6cee2509bdc7275 882e2e7c61b847a685a20655fb14309c
#: d193bcc885d642b5a0521d735787f953
msgid "Retrieving Geotagged Images"
msgstr "获取地理标记图像"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-drotagx.rst:59
#: 441e80c76b064fd9879eed357f499feb 48d963aa81bb4d86bd821e4c533b208e
#: 739b13bf96ef417c90135bea955efb58 cf316d60c3604b768c5f97a555d6b1b6
#: fecea587b948456e935c56c6352ad291
msgid ""
"Drotag writes the location information directly into the .jpg images files "
"using EXIF and also into two accompanying files on the camera's SD card"
msgstr "Drotag 使用 EXIF 将位置信息直接写入 .jpg 图像文件，同时写入相机 SD 卡上的两个附加文件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-drotagx.rst:61
#: 1d60c296f27f49d4ab4a6fb1f4bf2fa4 3ff66f3b70fc458581269bf0ba80091e
#: a0a80c0e4d6740919e42298d80f8ca06 ab5bab81fe244da9877e69589624218a
#: cd881b83d4cc4297885252b30f6dc87c
msgid ""
"Connect the camera's USB port to your PC or remove the SD card and download "
"to your PC"
msgstr "将相机 USB 端口连接到 PC 或取出 SD 卡下载到 PC"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-drotagx.rst:62
#: 25af0b0f69cf4720a57c53b367a626df 2847dbced5a947fcae231a81ac2cb367
#: 67e0529dbf1540e99afe5bd2fcf7a3b0 8077dd349e424b8085f92f6ed7b4a98e
#: df0a647d6685407d95e8bf54f156444d
msgid ""
"The location can be viewed with any EXIF viewer including Window's file "
"property viewer"
msgstr "位置可以用任何 EXIF 查看器查看，包括 Windows 文件属性查看器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-drotagx.rst:68
#: 2c3693d5adac48dfbb983eecacf652e2 5033ec915e8747b6815ff5f92eda4ade
#: 626db3b9d8254c0a812f7a3df78a0b42 71c9c957e0df4b1b95d4028e9c50ee8e
#: 76b41de5022a4e08aeb419d8d846bfda
msgid ""
"The PIX4D_xxxx.txt includes the image's lat, lon, alt, roll, pitch and yaw "
"information as shown below"
msgstr "PIX4D_xxxx.txt 包含图像的纬度、经度、高度、横滚、俯仰和偏航信息，如下所示"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-drotagx.rst:74
#: 067f4a07656e4989b5ed26e5a41f5762 700cc727e90649f5bd496753e4f54347
#: 8589aa8da27a44ae9ca0b4cd6c0942fb 9b55f69270a24ef5ab5ba39958fc04bb
